\pard\b\fs20 Shallow Water\b0\par
\fs16\par
At last your escape from this paradise seems to succeed... but what's that? Nooo! The water is disappearing and you watch the seabed come up to meet your keel!\par
So your escape isn't going to work out after all: you have to build a blimp!\par
Unfortunately the sea keeps retreating and coming back, which means you can only really build once the sea is shallower again. But watch out: with the water come the sharks!\par
